   416 :     }
   417 :     writeDeferredName();
   418 :     beforeValue();
   419 :     string(value);
   420 :     return this;
   421 : }
   ```

3. **`JsonWriter.value(long value)`**
   ```java
   499 : public JsonWriter value(long value) throws IOException {
   500 :     writeDeferredName();
   501 :     beforeValue();
   502 :     out.write(Long.toString(value));
   503 :     return this;
   504 : }
   ```

4. **`JsonWriter.value(Number value)`**
