   514 :     if (value == null) {
   515 :       return nullValue();
   516 :     }
   517 :     writeDeferredName();
   518 :     String string = value.toString();
   519 :     if (!lenient && (string.equals("-Infinity") || string.equals("Infinity") || string.equals("NaN"))) {
   520 :       throw new IllegalArgumentException("Numeric values must be finite, but was " + value);
   521 :     }
   522 :     beforeValue();
   523 :     out.append(string);
   524 :     return this;
   525 : }
   ```

5. **`JsonWriter.nullValue()`**
   ```java
